      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: SAMBAR pathway-based subtypes are what we want for 210 tumours, from a mutation matrix our core facility produced. I honestly don't know whether their calls are somatic (tumour versus matched normal) or germline variants; the README doesn't say and the analyst has left.\nUser follow-up: yes"
